    to target it: it FREEZES in place. Then SWEEP (LEFT + RIGHT mouse) to steer it
    around the three enemies. Press X to release it.

    EXPECT: the object stops
    when targeted and follows your cursor while you sweep. After X, it resumes toward
    the waypoint.'
  radius: 3
