  body: 'HOLD left-click and wait until the object is carried. Press K: the left
    waypoint flips to the enemy. Press L for the right one. Press K / L again to
    restore.

    EXPECT: K redirects the object to the other waypoint. K and L together
    make it STOP. Restore one and it continues.'
  radius: 3
